 "workflow": [
  "Never edit this template; make a Drive copy of the deck first (outside this mapping task), then work on the copy.",
  "In the copy, duplicateObject the template slide; pass objectIds {old_element_id: new_id} so fills are deterministic, or re-read the new slide with get_page to get generated IDs.",
  "Replace text: deleteText(objectId, textRange ALL) then insertText(objectId, text). Cards use line breaks between label / value / body - keep the same paragraph count to preserve styling.",
  "Tables: insertText with cellLocation; deleteTableRow / insertTableRow to resize.",
  "Delete all unused template slides (and slide 1) at the end; reorder with updateSlidesPosition."
 ],
